{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qApnSOHXpr1792662521.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣轉涼，想喝一碗鮮甜滋補又做法簡單的靚湯？不妨嘗試這道「松茸春菜滾雞湯」。利用凍乾松茸的濃郁香氣，配合春菜的清甜與嫩雞的鮮美，先煎後滾，滋味濃郁的美味佳湯！</p><p></p><p>食材（份量因人而異）</p><ul><li><p>新鮮雞 1隻</p></li><li><p>凍乾松茸 10克</p></li><li><p>春菜 600克</p></li><li><p>薑 30克</p></li><li><p>鹽 2茶匙</p></li><li><p>砂糖 1茶匙</p></li><li><p>生粉 適量</p></li><li><p>油 1茶匙</p></li></ul><p>烹調步驟</p><ol><li><p><strong>醃製雞隻</strong></p><p>將新鮮雞斬件，加入少許鹽及生粉醃製約 10 分鐘備用。</p></li><li><p><strong>煎香雞肉</strong></p><p>燒熱鍋，加入 1 茶匙油，將雞肉平鋪於鍋內煎至表皮金黃香口。</p></li><li><p><strong>滾煮調味</strong></p><p>倒出鍋內多餘的油分，加入適量清水、薑塊、春菜及凍乾松茸，大火滾煮 10 分鐘，最後加入鹽與砂糖調味，即可熱騰騰上桌。</p></li></ol><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a00b735b-3b00-49b7-8328-9ff6964a5665.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026N20L56CyEd1792662520.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.152561+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.470785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:51.261922+00:00","content_hash":"096f1a77e5b540a1c43e1c571d0983d2d368c2df2020f260f1bdebf09051b8ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.152561+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}